{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863491404835586108","content":"(note to self, I need to use disguise kit if I want to go through hampster place\nlong rest starts now even though I've done nothing that actually needs it besides exist\nI'm blaming (being distracted by) the pigeon's white noise for my blatant participation in the fight earlier, I could've been so much more subtle\nKukudh will be back when I'm asleep since I have 0 intention for them to interact with anything, if the pigeon acts at a similar time to this time they'll be back by then)\n\nSabrine reenters the Nightingale, checking her dusty hammock for invisible pigeons before flopping down onto it. 'Pigeon. I know not what your cause is, but you destabilised my mind with your accursed coo. You are welcome to stay, but please work with me, rather than inadvertently helping those who took over part of the city...'\ninvisibly and in the form of a four-winged raven, Kukudh flies out of the window to scout for a couple of hours before returning to rest themselves.","created_at":"2021-07-11T19:48:21.577000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863869344215466054","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
