{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863491404835586108","content":"\"I recall the fee back is one silver piece. Which is a bit inconvenient with red ones taking all the silver, I suppose. Honestly, at this point you might do better than me at dispatching some targets, like Apgan told us.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T10:50:56.667000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864096487126335488","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863491404835586108","content":"||Perhaps. I don't believe Kukudh to have been the source of my powers, since I am still able to use telepathy... without a focus though, I can only blast people with it, or occasionally reach into their minds and cause them to flee.||","created_at":"2021-07-12T10:54:30.628000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864097384543420426","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
